// Achievements: what the warband can earn, shared by every hero. docs/game/achievements.md has
// the rules and every criteria kind; docs/game/AUTHORING.md "An achievement" shows how to add one
// (copy docs/game/templates/achievement.ron). An id is kept in the save once shipped: never
// change one. Points are 0, 5, 10, 25 or 50. Rewards are stored by id for the steps that use them
// (titles, companions, trophies, the shop).
